      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STAR ZIPPER (4) is looking to continue her winning ways off an outstanding 22.17 victory at this track. In form and looks the one to beat again. KILCOY TIGER (5) caught the eye with a fast early split last time and setting up a 3 length win at The Gardens over 400m in 22.77, making it two wins on end. Leading chance again. HELLO CHEVY (3) had been in great form but missed the frame latest when fifth (30.63) in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Generally a safe beginner but buried in the ruck from a squeeze draw last time. Won at her only start from this draw. Likely to be thereabouts. PITMAN GO WELL (1) cannot be ruled out.",
